OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry.
OL,6,FRather cloudy in east and north. Clear
OL,7,Fspells focused in west. Risk of fog
OL,8,Fand rural frost, chiefly around
OL,9,Fnorthern end of Great Glen, Easter
OL,10,FRoss and Sutherland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FSettled and dry fare with
OL,13,Fbright and sunny spells increasing,
OL,14,Fbut early mist and fog may be slow to
OL,15,Fburn back. Winds light.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,18,FThursday dry with sunshine and light
OL,19,Fwinds. Friday cloudier with the chance
OL,20,Fof drizzly showers for Inverness.
OL,21,FSaturday cloudy but largely dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
